                                "sense_id": "b2780e8b-62c9-304d-8592-7d7a6d880648",
                                "text": "Ricky nodded, but it was clear his mind worked overtime to assess his situation. He looked around in quick nervous glances. “Fine. Do I get my hands untied?”\nBaker looked questioningly at Bruce, who nodded “yes” to him […]"
